description = Color(After refusing the wild demands of a tyrannical king, [PAWN_nameDef]'s nomad band was marked as an outlaw group and systematically hunted.\n\n[PAWN_nameDef]'s family was eventually captured. Those who weren't killed were taken as slaves. Sold to the owner of a manufactory, [PAWN_nameDef] swore that one day [PAWN_pronoun] would have [PAWN_possessive] revenge., 1.0)
